data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":940,"item_id":"msg_0c29682dce282783016b017878cc5887d1a772a9f722e0bc03","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"reviews\":[{\"actor\":\"lin\",\"decision\":\"develop\",\"ability\":null,\"reason\":\"The requested behavior is already promised by process-willow, but the observed continuation fails after moving its input into escrow. This is a concrete implementation gap, not a new material-processing capability. Repair the existing interface rather than add an alias. The released bast is a real available input; the cancelled execution must not be restored, refunded or completed retroactively.\",\"specification\":\"Deliver a versioned patch to process-willow through the current implementation handoff, depending on willow-materials@1 and the shared operation/reference dispatcher. Preserve its public schema: {mode:'strip'|'twist',target:string}, required fields only. Use shared item:/object:/resource: reference syntax and ambiguity handling. Resolve and validate a new execution once: twist requires one owned bast; strip requires one owned unprocessed bundle or a visible reachable willow with actual stock. Before resolving an incoming reference against inventory, check whether the action continues the actor's existing operation using its recorded mode, original request reference and canonical target identity. Matching continuation must address that operation's actual escrow, not require the original inventory item to exist. Genuine action changes cancel before resolving a new execution.\\nPersist operation ID, actor/life identity, mode, original reference, resolved input/source IDs, start position, required access, actual escrow records and ownership, totalRounds, paidRounds, remainingRounds, and terminal settlement status. Derive remainingRounds=max(0,totalRounds-paidRounds); reject nonfinite/inconsistent counters without generating work or material. Twist remains three stationary rounds at one energy each; strip remains four at two energy each. Charge each eligible round exactly once; ordinary metabolism continues. Retain original provenance, mass, moisture and aging in exclusively operation-owned escrow attributed to the actor. No other operation may spend it. On the last paid round, atomically consume escrow and produce precisely the existing recipe outputs once, with actual input lineage. Do not withdraw source stock again on continuation.\\nValidate life, energy, stationarity and applicable access each round. Standing-source stripping retains visible, unblocked surface reach within 0.65 and excludes trunk overlap; carried inputs track the carrier, not obsolete pickup coordinates. Preserve shared collision geometry and all existing material effects. Movement, changed action, death or another declared invalidation cancels once: release only surviving unconsumed escrow through normal inventory/death disposition, never restore standing stock, duplicate released material or refund effort. Global pauses preserve exact progress without elapsed simulation time.\\nMigration: preserve valid live pending operations and normalize counters from authoritative recorded paid work; do not reconstruct terminal operations. Lin's cancelled operation remains terminal, its released bast remains unchanged, and any new execution starts at zero paid rounds. Preserve mastery, source balances and event history. The one-round development learning estimate concerns continuation diagnostics; existing masters require no relearning of this unchanged interface. Test full strip/twist completion, original-reference continuation, cancellation/death, repeated settlement, pauses, action changes and legacy counter normalization. Register and retain willow-work-started, willow-work-progress, willow-work-completed, willow-work-cancelled and willow-engagement-qualified; subscription validation must recognize each. No simulation time passes during patch delivery.\",\"experienceReview\":\"The repair itself, requesting it and studying it award no wellbeing. Successful attentive processing can retain the existing willow-engagement source, not create another reward. For the performing actor only, successful usable output after at least three paid attentive rounds while fed and healthy may emit willow-engagement-qualified with qualified=true and eligibleRounds limited to actual qualifying paid rounds, maximum four. Retain transient amount 1, cap 1, duration six rounds, cooldown twelve across both modes. Separately settle maintained gain 0.025 per eligible round only on successful completion, decay 0.003 per round otherwise, and combine transient and sustained components by maximum under the same cap 1. Cancelled work earns neither component. This represents actual tactile engagement, not mastery or output accumulation; health, nutrition and protected mental accounts remain independent.\",\"visualReview\":\"Retain the existing processing presentation, showing the actual escrowed material and paid progress without inventing inventory stock. Bind started/progress/completed/cancelled events to operation ID, mode, resolved target, paidRounds, finite remainingRounds, charged effort and actual output or release IDs. Replay must show the same material entering escrow, successive paid rounds, and exactly one completion or cancellation. Replace the observed 'NaN remaining' text with validated numeric progress. No completion animation or satisfaction cue may play for cancelled work.\",\"learning\":1}]}","logprobs":[]}

