 any new execution starts at zero paid rounds. Preserve mastery, source balances and event history. The one-round development learning estimate concerns continuation diagnostics; existing masters require no relearning of this unchanged interface. Test full strip/twist completion, original-reference continuation, cancellation/death, repeated settlement, pauses, action changes and legacy counter normalization. Register and retain willow-work-started, willow-work-progress, willow-work-completed, willow-work-cancelled and willow-engagement-qualified; subscription validation must recognize each. No simulation time passes during patch delivery.\",\"experienceReview\":\"The repair itself, requesting it and studying it award no wellbeing. Successful attentive processing can retain the existing willow-engagement source, not create another reward. For the performing actor only, successful usable output after at least three paid attentive rounds while fed and healthy may emit willow-engagement-qualified with qualified=true and eligibleRounds limited to actual qualifying paid rounds, maximum four. Retain transient amount 1, cap 1, duration six rounds, cooldown twelve across both modes. Separately settle maintained gain 0.025 per eligible round only on successful completion, decay 0.003 per round otherwise, and combine transient and sustained components by maximum under the same cap 1. Cancelled work earns neither component. This represents actual tactile engagement, not mastery or output accumulation; health, nutrition and protected mental accounts remain independent.\",\"visualReview\":\"Retain the existing processing presentation, showing the actual escrowed material and paid progress without inventing inventory stock. Bind started/progress/completed/cancelled events to operation ID, mode, resolved target, paidRounds, finite remainingRounds, charged effort and actual output or release IDs. Replay must show the same material entering escrow, successive paid rounds, and exactly